  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Burundi IDF Procurement Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review the country institutional and legal framework linked to procurement, the practices and the general environment associated with procurement activities. Assess the risk associated with the procurement practices and process as it currently functioning in the country Develop in close collaboration with the government an action aimed to improve accountability, transparency, efficiency of the procurement process and reduce the scope for corrupt practices Provide guidance and support to services involved in the  implementation of the IDF aimed to support goverment&apos;s efforts aiming to reform and the modernize the Burundi Public Procurement</narrative>
  </description>
